#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:5 3d2909ff1b194d3db96acc2669b9e1fc
msgid "Hex HereFlow Optical Flow Sensor"
msgstr "Hex HereFlow 光流传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:9 7e43020a9c364de89376871413dc149b
msgid ""
"The `HereFlow optical flow sensor <http://www.proficnc.com/all-"
"products/185-pixhawk2-suite.html>`__ is a lightweight optical flow sensor "
"including a short range lidar which uses the CAN protocol to communicate "
"with the autopilot.  This can be used to improve horizontal position control"
" especially in GPS denied environments."
msgstr ""
"`HereFlow 光流传感器 <http://www.proficnc.com/all-"
"products/185-pixhawk2-suite.html>`__ 是一款轻量级光流传感器，内置短距激光雷达，使用 CAN "
"协议与飞控通信。可用于改善水平位置控制，特别是在无 GPS 环境中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:16 25bbee26f2e449b0bec4690f5c454fff
#: 3e546e663a5c4dceb58f468b8897a12c 78f34293172741589bdc4340afc9f808
#: ee0d5f90de7f438bbbba371ad08f67fc
msgid ""
"The lidar included with the HereFlow is very short range especially "
"outdoors.  We strongly recommend using a :ref:`longer range lidar instead "
"<common-rangefinder-landingpage>`."
msgstr ""
"HereFlow 自带的激光雷达测距范围非常短，尤其是在室外使用时。我们强烈建议改用 :ref:`更长测距范围的激光雷达 <common-"
"rangefinder-landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:19 06389dd0446244e8bff1e433934d6019
#: 394713db822e40cdb5ff0497ca8c04cc ce06ad47e5194f5c8cf5e01d4a75043a
#: f50deeec40c9436fb9c09d56fad669c8
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:21 0e7aa56d8c274e8da1c8ebab3f6df676
msgid ""
"The sensor is available from `Hex resellers "
"<http://www.proficnc.com/stores>`__"
msgstr "该传感器可从 `Hex 经销商 <http://www.proficnc.com/stores>`__ 购买"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:24 23ad2b5788794beba097c466d3ffef64
#: 2ea3d972b62f4af091ee0b1ddd95269f 69aeec3d5b8e4649845e340f42bd2fb8
#: f4b03fb9780041bfbe066af0026f00e7
msgid "Connection to Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:30 3cb2f40bc3884c4fb3c4eac8236e58b6
#: a04fd30c339448588f5d47e421370824 bbf269d61fe9440b93a10f60f63c6621
#: dd3c52baf1cd4b8d920869e63dda1c87
msgid ""
"The flow sensor should be mounted on the underside of the copter with the "
"camera lens pointing downwards.  The side of the sensor with the lens should"
" be towards the front of the vehicle."
msgstr "光流传感器应安装在飞行器底部，摄像头镜头朝下。传感器有镜头的一侧应朝向飞行器前方。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:31 47528db975514be9a7bc96fa45bd1373
#: 48030a9e3255482c9ec7fa2cfe8d1707 75fee82e5ec1440ba9860c10928c725f
#: d1caeea2c9c84797be7ad5b91a5552f9
msgid ""
"Connect the sensor to the autopilots' CAN port (if using a Cube note that "
"pre-Apr 2019 boards have CAN1 and CAN2 swapped)"
msgstr "将传感器连接到飞控的 CAN 端口（如果使用 Cube，请注意 2019 年 4 月之前的板子 CAN1 和 CAN2 是互换的）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:32 2f48f965e8c745ee99afd0de4586c3cc
#: 734ff5b98b264cb298be106a59fd85bf 7c5592515dc1402d9f84ad5cfa5ef359
#: bc88a06c63e649698e54d780d74b4976
msgid "Set :ref:`FLOW_TYPE <FLOW_TYPE>` = 6 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`FLOW_TYPE <FLOW_TYPE>` 设置为 6（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:33 064f099df4434f069f8cbfa96b08c2a4
#: 650fca39b673466398b3400fd971e5b6 a2a8cb38f53743df889ae4ec9392a7db
#: ddda19292a3e43119236968c1d17d22a
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 to enable DroneCAN"
msgstr "将 :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` 设置为 1 以启用 DroneCAN"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:34 286da72f5e9d4d278376776036285819
#: 3da5403de7374469939e8468915e0fc7 6daf35b60d964ef282e8d1b93d7d2270
#: 9c9295de309c495e8e7ff600e59f4edc
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` 设置为 1（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:35 24ae596d6442494b84eb67da442bd427
#: 671ed1286d124672880cfce9e7c3d7c1 93069c4b0a4e49108a4c0d0b0be61d81
#: b3af7d9fe5994af7ade1fb157188e6e8
msgid ""
"Optionally set :ref:`BRD_BOOT_DELAY <BRD_BOOT_DELAY>` = 3000 (3 seconds) to "
"slow the autopilot's startup which allows the flow sensor to boot up first "
"and avoid initialisation issues"
msgstr ""
"可选设置 :ref:`BRD_BOOT_DELAY <BRD_BOOT_DELAY>` = 3000（3 "
"秒），以减慢飞控启动速度，使光流传感器优先完成启动，避免初始化问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:37 3182d5f431bb4b2093dbe8804f2f4450
#: 4835faf478f14fbfb50e4880ad712b62 4fd40b688e0b492f89ec438f40f6fc3c
#: ad645b791e6f47e194cc9d1375297a36
msgid "To use the onboard lidar (not recommended):"
msgstr "如需使用机载激光雷达（不推荐）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:39 09e9543b4c6b43379dcc6d82aa736d82
#: 4f2429b7400849078846c3cf4122731e 575b905a4de74b53b035c1fa68247d05
#: f7bf36c8fba84c73a52782c295732f45
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 24 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` 设置为 24（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:40 478f870b8a3e4ecf8abf9b7700beac31
#: 98aa5a4091144f8fb738ee19105a8719 ad946a21553848d0a80c6cfb83bf4979
#: c52a132a868b4336b834b6b6166e92ef
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 3 to set range finder's maximum range"
" to 3m"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 3，将测距仪最大测距范围设为 3m"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:43 1282aa6976ac48c3addac48cb49ed23b
#: b91f8e56259144ceb1a39eae9894a770 e791843d284a4fefa63c5c91a3337509
#: fd4cbd47f8064e53954f59bf06a2d30b
msgid "Additional Notes"
msgstr "附加说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:45 84df5480e9e6484998bf845d5d23b54f
#: c144987809f24d86947507dd964a3de2 d44b8b8787e84c3cb4ad2cafbf754611
#: d70d4f67e1a541fa8e037dbd03e4a158
msgid ""
"As with the :ref:`PX4Flow sensor <common-px4flow-overview>` a range finder "
"is required to use the sensor for autonomous modes including :ref:`Loiter "
"<loiter-mode>` and :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`"
msgstr ""
"与 :ref:`PX4Flow 传感器 <common-px4flow-overview>` 一样，在 Loiter 和 RTL "
"等自主模式中使用该传感器需要配备测距仪（:ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 和 :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:46 2ba4db041ba54ca3b4fa4b4ba10b6ce0
#: 7250fbd3a725499e96604b695afe1e23 b18dbdea338c4f1696c1e9d6189b98e0
#: fba1e317a06746d28dfe8d04d7bd8113
msgid ""
":ref:`FlowHold <flowhold-mode>` does not require the use of a rangefinder"
msgstr ":ref:`FlowHold <flowhold-mode>` 模式无需使用测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:47 22143a1699234ea5aaaf9010a8941475
#: 2ae4bca68a90412cbfd7c139dc060512 c383481e5e3148f696a5592e6a7e7b44
#: f11dfcf2ba4a4c94abb9d8191ec73523
msgid ""
"Performance can be improved by setting the :ref:`sensors position parameters"
" <common-sensor-offset-compensation>`.  For example if the sensor is mounted"
" 2cm forward and 5cm below the frame's center of rotation set "
":ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` to 0.02 and :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` to"
" 0.05."
msgstr ""
"通过设置 :ref:`传感器位置参数 <common-sensor-offset-compensation>` "
"可以提升性能。例如，若传感器安装在机架旋转中心前方 2cm、下方 5cm 处，将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` 设为 "
"0.02，将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` 设为 0.05。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hereflow.rst:50 5dd7379399ab477994f9f45d99cb9e88
